  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Elaboration of a basis for a Transboundary Diagnostic Analysis which in a later phase will be developed into a Straegic Action Plan for improved national and regional activities for protection of the Bay ofBengal ecosystem and sustainably manage its living marine resources.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utarbetande av underlag f&#xf6;r en Transboundary Diagnostic Analysis som i en senare fas ska resultera i ett strategiskt handlingsprogram f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrade nationella och regionala insatser f&#xf6;r skydd av Bay of Bengals ekosystem och h&#xe5;llbart f&#xf6;rvalta dess levande marina resurser.</narrative>
  </description>
